#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Base32 encode or decode FILE, or standard input, to standard output."
msgstr ""
"„Base32“ кодира или декодира ДАТОТЕКУ, или стандардни улаз, на стандардни "
"излаз."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "With no FILE, or when FILE is -, read standard input."
msgstr "Без ДАТОТЕКЕ, или када је ДАТОТЕКА -, чита стандардни улаз."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Mandatory arguments to long options are mandatory for short options too."
msgstr ""
"Обавезни аргументи за дуге опције су обавезни и за кратке опције такође."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-d>, B<--decode>"
msgstr "B<-d>, B<--decode>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "decode data"
msgstr "декодира податке"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-i>, B<--ignore-garbage>"
msgstr "B<-i>, B<--ignore-garbage>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "when decoding, ignore non-alphabet characters"
msgstr "када декодира, занемарује не-словне знакове"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-w>, B<--wrap>=I<\\,COLS\\/>"
msgstr "B<-w>, B<--wrap>=I<\\,СТУПЦИ\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"wrap encoded lines after COLS character (default 76).  Use 0 to disable line "
"wrapping"
msgstr ""
"прелама кодиране редове након СТУБАЦА знакова (основно је 76). Користите 0 "
"да искључите преламање реда"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--help>"
msgstr "B<--help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display this help and exit"
msgstr "приказује ову помоћ и излази"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--version>"
msgstr "B<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output version information and exit"
msgstr "исписује податке о издању и излази"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The data are encoded as described for the base32 alphabet in RFC 4648.  When "
"decoding, the input may contain newlines in addition to the bytes of the "
"formal base32 alphabet.  Use B<--ignore-garbage> to attempt to recover from "
"any other non-alphabet bytes in the encoded stream."
msgstr ""
"Подаци се кодирају као што је описано за алфабет основе base32 у РФЦ 4648. "
"Приликом декодирања, улаз може садржати нове редове као додатак бајтовима "
"званичног алфабета base32. Користите B<--ignore-garbage> да покушате да "
"опоравите од свих других не-алфабетских бајтова у кодираном току."

